{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":1,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"The lighthouse foundation survey. Government money, three years of work, and a background check on every principal."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":1,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"And my name is on a denied insurance claim from six years ago."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":1,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Your name is on worse than that."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":2,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Put Teddy's name on it as principal. Not yours."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"It is my company."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":2,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"And it is his reputation that will pass the check."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":3,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"If I sign as principal, I am liable for everything you do for three years."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":3,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"Yes."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":3,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"And you are not going to promise me anything about how you behave."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":3,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"No. I am not."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":4,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"He called me. He did not ask for anything. He wanted to know if the boy should sign."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":4,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Okonkwo","text":"What did you tell him?"}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":4,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"That I would come and watch the first year myself. I do not say that lightly."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":5,"character":"Bosun","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"Whole coast is betting on how long it lasts."}
{"season":6,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Lighthouse Contract","scene":5,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Bosun","text":"I put money on three years. It felt like a betrayal in both directions."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":1,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Fourteen months. Nothing new on the list."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":1,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"Because I stopped putting things on it."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":1,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"That is one way to fix a list."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":2,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"The survey wants a fourth season of diving and the budget covers three."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"Then we tell them three."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":2,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Six years ago you would have told them four and worked out the money later."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":3,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"I need to hear you say a date and then I need the date to be true. One last time, for the file."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":3,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"The eleventh."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":4,"character":"Bosun","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"He filed on the eleventh. Nine in the morning."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":5,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"One year watched. I am going home."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":5,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Okonkwo","text":"I know better than to ask you to stay."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":5,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"That is the change. Not the paperwork."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":6,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"Do I throw the list away?"}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":6,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"Keep it. Not as a grievance. As a measurement."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":7,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"Ask me for something. Anything. I want to see if I can just do it."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":7,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Come up when I call you."}
{"season":6,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Everything He Said","scene":7,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"Okay."}
